00:00:16,620 --> 00:00:17,900
Rei, Kiriyama.

4
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:22,220
The day has finally come for us to play against each other in public.

5
00:00:22,780 --> 00:00:27,640
This letter just arrived for me in the mail, so I figured that you would be receiving one as well.

6
00:00:27,640 --> 00:00:30,100
That's why I decided to come right over.

7
00:00:30,620 --> 00:00:34,820
Be it right or wrong, I just felt like I had to deliver it to you with my own hands.

8
