11
00:00:42,520 --> 00:00:48,040
It's true that it did take me two years longer to reach 4th Den, but this is now our true start.

12
00:00:49,060 --> 00:00:52,920
Let the true battle between us begin.

13
00:00:53,080 --> 00:00:56,080
You even opened the envelope! That's a crime, I hope you know!

14
00:00:56,080 --> 00:01:01,180
Ever since the first day I played against you at the National Children's Shogi Championship 10 years ago,

15
00:01:01,440 --> 00:01:06,480
I decided you would be my lifelong rival, and every day I have strived to make steady progress.

16
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:10,320
I've researched in the moonlight, read by the light of the fireflies,

17
00:01:10,460 --> 00:01:13,920
and convinced myself that I was simply born a late bloomer.

18
00:01:15,380 --> 00:01:18,420
However, the truth is I'm a genius too.

19
00:01:19,380 --> 00:01:19,840
Hey!

20
00:01:20,640 --> 00:01:21,180
Wait!

21
00:01:21,180 --> 00:01:24,440
You bastard!

22
00:01:24,900 --> 00:01:26,540
I was still talking!

23
00:01:27,500 --> 00:01:29,740
