24
00:01:29,820 --> 00:01:31,760
No, not until you take it from my hand!

25
00:01:31,880 --> 00:01:34,020
This notification is a declaration of war!

26
00:01:34,360 --> 00:01:37,520
Never mind, I'll call the association for the information myself!

27
00:01:37,660 --> 00:01:39,140
Don't be so cold to a buddy!

28
00:01:39,340 --> 00:01:40,480
We're best friends, remember?

29
00:01:40,780 --> 00:01:41,500
Best friends?

30
00:01:41,840 --> 00:01:43,360
This is the first I've heard of that!

31
00:01:43,560 --> 00:01:44,700
Where'd you get that idea?

32
00:01:44,700 --> 00:01:46,620
Isn't that the way it always goes?

33
00:01:46,740 --> 00:01:49,760
We strive, we have our rivalry, and we overcome our challenges!

34
00:01:50,080 --> 00:01:51,380
And in the end, high five!

35
00:01:51,580 --> 00:01:53,340
We become best friends forever!

36
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:54,700
Got it?

37
00:01:55,120 --> 00:01:56,480
