I like the river. There aren't many things that I really like, but watching the way the river flows is almost hypnotic. It really helps to ease my mind. It's only one subway stop to Sendagaya, but on my game days, I like to look at the river on the way, so I walk to the nearest train station.

92
00:05:24,807 --> 00:05:41,807
