93
00:05:41,807 --> 00:05:55,807
A professional shogi player has 30 to 40 matches a year. There are title matches and rank deciding competitions, mostly held in tournaments. So the more you win, the more matches you end up playing.

94
00:05:55,807 --> 00:06:13,807
There are even some top class players who have 70 to 80 matches a year. Today's match is a qualifier for the NHK Cup. It's an important match. If I can make it past the qualifying round this time, then I'll be able to participate in the final televised tournament.

95
00:06:13,807 --> 00:06:25,807
